# Personalize extras — append-only onto Neuronix default/install-list
# @manifest-format: 1
#
# Duplicate names are skipped (base wins). Omit sections you do not need.
# Desktop profile installs server + desktop lists; Server installs server only.
#
# Put console / daemons / CLI under # --- server --- (both profiles).
# Put GUI / media / creative apps under # --- desktop --- (Desktop only).
#
# Copy this file to ../personalize/install-list and edit for your machine.
# Example below is illustrative — replace with your real package set.

# --- server ---
# git # fast, scalable, distributed revision control system
# docker.io # Linux container runtime
# nginx # small, powerful, scalable web/proxy server

# --- desktop ---
# gimp # GNU Image Manipulation Program
# vlc # multimedia player and streamer
